id=oplus_ddrc_control
name=OPlus DDRC Control
version=v0.1.1-alpha
versionCode=2
author=BakaronLab
description=Runtime override of the OPlus DDRC low-battery voltage policy (GAUGE_TERM_VOLTAGE / GAUGE_SHUTDOWN_VOLTAGE) through the kernel votable debug-force interface. Default BALANCED; FULL_OEM is experimental and opt-in. Both profiles are validated against the live device tree at apply time and fail closed to STOCK. Writes no partitions, no boot images and no persistent gauge data. Tested only on PKU110 (silicon_1).
